     _n_t_p_k_e_y_ RRSSAA--MMDD55 __ _c_e_r_t___a_l_i_c_e_. _f_i_l_e_s_t_a_m_p, and soft links.  Copy both files
     to all group hosts; they replace the files which would be generated in
     other schemes.  On each host _b_o_b install a soft link from the generic
     name _n_t_p_k_e_y___h_o_s_t___b_o_b to the host key file and soft link _n_t_p_k_e_y___c_e_r_t___b_o_b
